":"Single Best Answer MCQ","subject":"Unclassified Health Sciences","topic":"Unassigned topic","topicOriginal":"General","subtopic":"","suggestedTopic":null,"options":[{"label":"A","text":"The sugar component of a nucleotide is always ribose."},{"label":"B","text":"The sugar component of a nucleotide is always deoxyribose."},{"label":"C","text":"The bases in nucleotides are attached to the pentose sugar moieties by a glycosidic bond."},{"label":"D","text":"The sugar component of a nucleotide is in the L-configuration."}],"priority":2,"status":"practice_draft","flags":["subject_unclassified","topic_generic"],"keyVerified":false,"hasSourceAnswer":false,"needsFigure":false,"displaySubject":"Unclassified Health Sciences","displayTopic":"Unassigned topic","answerAuditStatus":"not_adjudicated","sourceAnswerTrusted":false,"publicationStatus":"review_required","auditFlags":["subject_needs_classification","subject_unclassified","topic_generic"],"cleaningOperations":["whitespace/page_marker_normalization"]},{"id":"q-997c982477a0","stem":"Which of the following statements about the de novo synthesis of purine nucleotides is correct?","type":"Single Best Answer MCQ","subject":"Unclassified Health Sciences","topic":"Unassigned topic","topicOriginal":"General","subtopic":"","suggestedTopic":null,"options":[{"label":"A","text":"AMP is the first purine nucleotide assembled from the de novo pathway."},{"label":"B","text":"The enzyme PRPP amidotransferase catalyses the committed step of the de novosynthesis pathway."},{"label":"C","text":"IMP is a competitive inhibitor of PRPP synthetase."},{"label":"D","text":"AMP is a competitive inhibitor of PRPP amidotransferase."}],"priority":2,"status":"practice_draft","flags":["subject_unclassified","topic_generic"],"keyVerified":false,"hasSourceAnswer":false,"needsFigure":false,"displaySubject":"Unclassified Health Sciences","displayTopic":"Unassigned topic","answerAuditStatus":"not_adjudicated","sourceAnswerTrusted":false,"publicationStatus"